$ oikade devices
Error: oikade devices doesn't list devices any more
Usage:
  oikade devices remove DEVICE [--allow-safety] [--json]
  oikade devices remove --plugin NAME [--allow-safety] [--json]
Hint: oikade list devices lists them
exit 2

$ oikade devices --json
Error: oikade devices doesn't list devices any more
Usage:
  oikade devices remove DEVICE [--allow-safety] [--json]
  oikade devices remove --plugin NAME [--allow-safety] [--json]
Hint: oikade list devices lists them
exit 2

$ oikade secret list
Error: oikade secret doesn't list secrets any more
Usage:
  oikade secret set NAME [--json]
  oikade secret remove NAME [--json]
Hint: oikade list secrets does
exit 2

$ oikade client list
Error: oikade client doesn't list clients any more
Usage:
  oikade client revoke NAME [--json]
Hint: oikade list clients does
exit 2

$ oikade logs
Error: oikade has no logs command
Hint: oikade history shows what your home did, and oikade tail follows it
exit 2

$ oikade events
Error: oikade has no events command
Hint: oikade history shows what your home did, and oikade tail follows it
exit 2

$ oikade ls
Error: oikade has no ls command
Hint: oikade list KIND lists devices, rules, plugins, secrets, clients or contexts
exit 2

$ oikade get
Error: oikade has no get command
Hint: oikade status REF shows what something is doing now, and oikade list KIND what's on record
exit 2

$ oikade show
Error: oikade has no show command
Hint: oikade status REF shows what something is doing now, and oikade list KIND what's on record
exit 2

